  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can see through the deepest gloom. You have Darkvision with a range of 300 feet; within it, you see in Dim Light as if it were Bright Light and in Darkness as if it were Dim Light. As a Magic action, you can share this Darkvision with willing creatures you can see within 10 feet of you, up to a number equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum of one), for 1 hour. Once you share it, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest, unless you expend a spell slot of any level to share it again.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
